cture>303</picture> <tab/>(1)((2))(((1))) </p>\n<p> [[578.7]] <tab/>(1)((2)) </p>\n<p> [[578.8]] <tab/>(1)((2))(((2))) </p>\n<p> [[578.9]] 1 </p>\n<p> [[578.10]] <tab/><picture>303</picture> <tab/>(2)((1))(((1))) </p>\n<p> [[578.11]] <tab/><picture>305</picture> <tab/>(2)((1)) </p>\n<p> [[578.12]] <tab/>(2)((1))(((2))) </p>\n<p> [[578.13]] <tab/>(2) </p>\n<p> [[578.14]] <tab/><picture>303</picture> <tab/>(2)((2))(((1))) </p>\n<p> [[578.15]] <tab/>(2)((2)) </p>\n<p> [[578.16]] <tab/>(2)((2))(((2))) </p>\n<p> [[578.17]] 1(2)((2))(((1))) significat primi argumenti, responsionis secundae, replicae secundae\n[[578.18]] duplica prima. </p>\n","number":"137.","title":"Methodus disputandi usque ad exhaustionem materiae, Kunst außzudisputiren","date":"[Sommer 1683 bis Winter 1685/86 (?)]"}
